@startuml
title FreeConnect - Monolito modular y dependencias

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
left to right direction

package "shared" as SH {
  [Result / paginacion / Money]
  [Eventos de dominio]
  [Seguridad / errores]
}

package "identity" as ID {
  [Auth / JWT / refresh]
}
package "profiles" as PR {
  [Perfiles / skills / portafolio]
}
package "projects" as PJ {
  [Proyectos / filtros / plantillas]
}
package "proposals" as PP {
  [Propuestas / validacion]
}
package "contracts" as CT {
  [Contratos / hitos / entregables]
}
package "messaging" as MS {
  [Conversaciones / mensajes]
}
package "reviews" as RV {
  [Resenas / reputacion]
}
package "payments" as PY {
  [Pagos / comisiones]
}
package "notifications" as NT {
  [Outbox / canales]
}
package "admin" as AD {
  [Reportes / moderacion]
}
package "audit" as AU {
  [Auditoria]
}

ID ..> SH
PR ..> SH
PJ ..> SH
PP ..> SH
CT ..> SH
MS ..> SH
RV ..> SH
PY ..> SH
NT ..> SH
AD ..> SH
AU ..> SH

CT ..> PP : lee propuesta aceptada
CT ..> PJ : actualiza proyecto
MS ..> CT : valida participantes
RV ..> CT : exige contrato completado
RV ..> PR : actualiza reputacion
PY ..> CT : valida monto y partes
AD ..> PJ
AD ..> CT
AD ..> ID
NT ..> CT : contrato para notificar
NT ..> PJ : proyecto para notificar

NT <.. PP : ProposalSubmitted/Accepted
NT <.. CT : Contract/Milestone events
NT <.. MS : MessageSentEvent
NT <.. RV : ReviewCreatedEvent
NT <.. PY : PaymentReleasedEvent
AU <.. ID : eventos
AU <.. PJ : eventos
AU <.. PP : eventos
AU <.. CT : eventos
AU <.. MS : eventos
AU <.. RV : eventos
AU <.. PY : eventos

note bottom of SH
  Regla de dependencia: domain no conoce Spring/JPA.
  api -> application -> domain <- infrastructure.
  Las flechas discontinuas hacia NT/AU representan eventos
  (Observer), no acoplamiento directo.
end note
@enduml
